+**Pitfalls and Edge Cases:**
+*   *Coordinate System Mismatch:* `ExitPointCoord` is in clip-space. Do not perform perspective division manually. Use `gl_FragCoord` directly as it corresponds to the rasterized position [S2, unofficial].
+*   *AMD Debugging Issue:* The `VerClr` input variable must be used in the vertex shader, or it causes debugging difficulties on AMD video cards [S2, unofficial].
+*   *Floating-Point Texture Support:* The volume data texture requires the `OES_texture_float` extension to support floating-point textures in WebGL. If this extension is not available, the initialization fails [S3, unofficial].
